#: scripts-cmake/setup.sh:91
msgid ""
"Usage: scripts-cmake/setup.sh [action] [options]\n"
"\n"
"Checks the native build requirements, configures CMake for a per-user "
"prefix,\n"
"and provides an interactive menu when no action is specified.\n"
"\n"
"Actions (choose only one):\n"
"  --check             Check tools and configure CMake without compiling.\n"
"  --build             Configure and compile the native module.\n"
"  --install           Install the current compiled build for this user.\n"
"  --build-install     Configure, compile, and install for this user.\n"
"  --inspect           Inspect the configured installation in temporary "
"staging.\n"
"  --restart-plasma    Restart Plasma Shell without compiling or installing.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  -j, --jobs N        Number of parallel build jobs (default: 1).\n"
"  --no-restart        Do not ask to restart Plasma Shell after "
"installation.\n"
"  -y, --yes           Restart Plasma Shell after installation without "
"prompting.\n"
"  --lang CODE         Select en, es, de, or pt_BR for assistant messages.\n"
"  -h, --help          Show this help.\n"
"\n"
"This assistant does not install system packages, use a package manager, "
"create\n"
"a .plasmoid artifact, or run the developer validation suite."
msgstr ""
"Uso: scripts-cmake/setup.sh [acción] [opciones]\n"
"\n"
"Comprueba los requisitos de compilación nativa, configura CMake con un "
"prefijo por usuario\n"
"y proporciona un menú interactivo cuando no se especifica una acción.\n"
"\n"
"Acciones (elija solo una):\n"
"  --check             Comprobar herramientas y configurar CMake sin "
"compilar.\n"
"  --build             Configurar y compilar el módulo nativo.\n"
"  --install           Instalar la compilación actual para este usuario.\n"
"  --build-install     Configurar, compilar e instalar para este usuario.\n"
"  --inspect           Inspeccionar la instalación configurada en un staging "
"temporal.\n"
"  --restart-plasma    Reiniciar Plasma Shell sin compilar ni instalar.\n"
"\n"
"Opciones:\n"
"  -j, --jobs N        Número de tareas de compilación paralelas "
"(predeterminado: 1).\n"
"  --no-restart        No preguntar si se debe reiniciar Plasma Shell tras la "
"instalación.\n"
"  -y, --yes           Reiniciar Plasma Shell tras instalar sin preguntar.\n"
"  --lang CÓDIGO       Seleccionar en, es, de o pt_BR para los mensajes del "
"asistente.\n"
"  -h, --help          Mostrar esta ayuda.\n"
"\n"
"Este asistente no instala paquetes del sistema, no usa un gestor de "
"paquetes, no crea\n"
"un artefacto .plasmoid ni ejecuta la suite de validación para "
"desarrolladores."

#: scripts-dev/distro/arch-setup.sh:65
msgid ""
"Usage: scripts-dev/distro/arch-setup.sh [options]\n"
"\n"
"Prepare Arch Linux or a supported Arch-family distribution for Punchi Dock "
"and\n"
"create a native package. By default the script creates the artifact without\n"
"installing it.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  -j, --jobs N        Set parallel build and test jobs count (e.g. -j 1 for "
"safe mode).\n"
"  --parallel N        Alias for --jobs.\n"
"  --yes               Pass --noconfirm to pacman.\n"
"  --skip-pacman       Do not run pacman; only verify and build.\n"
"  --dependencies-only Install and verify dependencies without building.\n"
"  --local-test        Build, install, restart Plasma Shell, and collect "
"logs.\n"
"  --dry-run           Print planned commands without changing the system.\n"
"  -h, --help          Show this help.\n"
"\n"
"Run this script as the desktop user, not with sudo. It requests sudo only "
"when\n"
"pacman must install missing packages. Package installation performs a "
"complete\n"
"system upgrade because partial upgrades are unsupported on Arch Linux."
msgstr ""
"Uso: scripts-dev/distro/arch-setup.sh [opciones]\n"
"\n"
"Prepara Arch Linux o una distribución de la familia Arch para Punchi Dock y\n"
"crea un paquete nativo. De forma predeterminada, el script crea el artefacto "
"sin\n"
"instalarlo.\n"
"\n"
"Opciones:\n"
"  -j, --jobs N        Establece el número de tareas de compilación y pruebas "
"en paralelo (ej. -j 1 para modo seguro).\n"
"  --parallel N        Alias de --jobs.\n"
"  --yes               Pasa --noconfirm a pacman.\n"
"  --skip-pacman       No ejecuta pacman; solo verifica y compila.\n"
"  --dependencies-only Instala y verifica dependencias sin compilar.\n"
"  --local-test        Compila, instala, reinicia Plasma Shell y recopila "
"registros.\n"
"  --dry-run           Muestra las órdenes planificadas sin modificar el "
"sistema.\n"
"  -h, --help          Muestra esta ayuda.\n"
"\n"
"Ejecuta este script como usuario del escritorio, no con sudo. Solo solicita "
"sudo cuando\n"
"pacman necesita instalar paquetes faltantes. La instalación realiza una "
"actualización\n"
"completa del sistema porque las actualizaciones parciales no son compatibles "
"en Arch Linux."

#: scripts-dev/setup.sh:38
msgid ""
"Usage: scripts-dev/setup.sh [options | path_to_package.plasmoid]\n"
"\n"
"Master interactive and CLI assistant for packaging, testing and installing\n"
"Punchi Dock Remastered. Automatically detects the host distribution\n"
"(Fedora, Debian 13, or Arch Linux and supported derivatives).\n"
"\n"
"If run without arguments, it opens the accessible interactive menu.\n"
"\n"
"CLI Options:\n"
"  -j, --jobs N        Set parallel build and test jobs count (e.g. -j 1 for "
"safe mode).\n"
"  --parallel N        Alias for --jobs.\n"
"  --local-test        Build, install on local Plasma Shell and collect "
"logs.\n"
"  --clean-install     Remove existing installation, rebuild and install "
"fresh.\n"
"  --yes               Pass affirmative answer to the package manager.\n"
"  --skip-dnf          Skip DNF installation on Fedora.\n"
"  --skip-apt          Skip APT installation on Debian.\n"
"  --skip-update       Skip apt-get update on Debian.\n"
"  --skip-pacman       Skip pacman installation on Arch Linux.\n"
"  --dependencies-only Check and install dependencies without building.\n"
"  --uninstall         Remove the plasmoid from the local Plasma "
"installation.\n"
"  --dry-run           Show planned commands without modifying the system.\n"
"  --lang CODE         Override the detected language (en, es, de, pt_BR).\n"
"  -h, --help          Show this help.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  ./scripts-dev/setup.sh                            # Interactive menu mode\n"
"  ./scripts-dev/setup.sh --local-test               # Quick local test mode\n"
"  ./scripts-dev/setup.sh --clean-install            # Force clean reinstall\n"
"  ./scripts-dev/setup.sh dist/my-package.plasmoid   # Direct .plasmoid "
"install"
msgstr ""
"Uso: scripts-dev/setup.sh [opciones | ruta_al_paquete.plasmoid]\n"
"\n"
"Asistente interactivo y CLI para empaquetar, probar e instalar\n"
"Punchi Dock Remastered. Detecta automáticamente la distribución anfitriona\n"
"(Fedora, Debian 13 o Arch Linux y derivados compatibles).\n"
"\n"
"Si se ejecuta sin argumentos, abre el menú interactivo accesible.\n"
"\n"
"Opciones CLI:\n"
"  -j, --jobs N        Establece el número de tareas de compilación y pruebas "
"en paralelo (ej. -j 1 para modo seguro).\n"
"  --parallel N        Alias de --jobs.\n"
"  --local-test        Compila, instala en Plasma Shell local y recopila "
"registros.\n"
"  --clean-install     Elimina la instalación existente, recompila e instala "
"de cero.\n"
"  --yes               Pasa respuesta afirmativa al gestor de paquetes.\n"
"  --skip-dnf          Omite la instalación con DNF en Fedora.\n"
"  --skip-apt          Omite la instalación con APT en Debian.\n"
"  --skip-update       Omite apt-get update en Debian.\n"
"  --skip-pacman       Omite la instalación con pacman en Arch Linux.\n"
"  --dependencies-only Comprueba e instala dependencias sin compilar.\n"
"  --uninstall         Elimina el plasmoide de la instalación local de "
"Plasma.\n"
"  --dry-run           Muestra las órdenes planificadas sin modificar el "
"sistema.\n"
"  --lang CÓDIGO       Anula el idioma detectado (en, es, de, pt_BR).\n"
"  -h, --help          Muestra esta ayuda.\n"
"\n"
"Ejemplos:\n"
"  ./scripts-dev/setup.sh                            # Modo de menú "
"interactivo\n"
"  ./scripts-dev/setup.sh --local-test               # Modo de prueba local "
"rápida\n"
"  ./scripts-dev/setup.sh --clean-install            # Forzar reinstalación "
"limpia\n"
"  ./scripts-dev/setup.sh dist/mi-paquete.plasmoid   # Instalación directa "
"de .plasmoid"

#: scripts-user/setup-universal.sh:100
msgid ""
"Usage: scripts-user/setup-universal.sh [--no-restart] <path/to/"
"package.plasmoid>"
msgstr ""
"Uso: scripts-user/setup-universal.sh [--no-restart] <ruta/al/"
