#: scripts-user/setup-universal.sh:29
msgid ""
"Usage: scripts-user/setup-universal.sh [--no-restart] [path/to/"
"package.plasmoid]\n"
"\n"
"Installs or updates Punchi Dock Remastered from an existing .plasmoid "
"package.\n"
"Plasma Shell is restarted afterward unless --no-restart is specified.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  --no-restart   Install without restarting Plasma Shell.\n"
"  --lang CODE    Override the detected language (en, es, de, pt_BR).\n"
"  -h, --help     Show this help.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  scripts-user/setup-"
"universal.sh                                                      # Select "
"the newest universal package in dist/\n"
"  scripts-user/setup-universal.sh --no-"
"restart                                         # Install without restarting "
"the desktop\n"
"  scripts-user/setup-universal.sh dist/punchi-dock-remastered-0.9.7-"
"universal.plasmoid # Install an explicit package"
msgstr ""
"Uso: scripts-user/setup-universal.sh [--no-restart] [ruta/al/"
"paquete.plasmoid]\n"
"\n"
"Instala o actualiza Punchi Dock Remastered desde un paquete .plasmoid "
"existente.\n"
"Plasma Shell se reinicia después, salvo que se indique --no-restart.\n"
"\n"
"Opciones:\n"
"  --no-restart   Instalar sin reiniciar Plasma Shell.\n"
"  --lang CÓDIGO  Sustituir el idioma detectado (en, es, de, pt_BR).\n"
"  -h, --help     Mostrar esta ayuda.\n"
"\n"
"Ejemplos:\n"
"  scripts-user/setup-"
"universal.sh                                                      # "
"Seleccionar el paquete universal más reciente de dist/\n"
"  scripts-user/setup-universal.sh --no-"
"restart                                         # Instalar sin reiniciar el "
"escritorio\n"
"  scripts-user/setup-universal.sh dist/punchi-dock-remastered-0.9.7-"
"universal.plasmoid # Instalar un paquete específico"

#: scripts-user/setup.sh:29
msgid ""
"Usage: scripts-user/setup.sh [options] [path/to/package.plasmoid]\n"
"\n"
"Builds Punchi Dock Remastered for the current Linux system without running\n"
"developer tests, creates a local .plasmoid package, installs it, and "
"manages\n"
"Plasma Shell integration.\n"
"\n"
"If run without a primary action, it opens the interactive setup menu.\n"
"\n"
"Primary actions (choose only one):\n"
"  --install         Build and install the plasmoid locally.\n"
"  --build-only      Build the local package without installing or restarting "
"Plasma.\n"
"  --package         Alias for --build-only.\n"
"  --check-deps      Check system build dependencies for the current "
"distribution.\n"
"  --uninstall       Uninstall the plasmoid from the local Plasma "
"environment.\n"
"  --restart-plasma  Restart Plasma Shell on demand.\n"
"\n"
"Modifiers:\n"
"  -j, --jobs N      Set the number of parallel build jobs (e.g. -j 1 for "
"safe mode).\n"
"  --parallel N      Alias for --jobs.\n"
"  --no-restart      Skip restarting Plasma Shell after install or "
"uninstall.\n"
"  -y, --yes         Automatically confirm a restart prompt.\n"
"  --lang CODE       Override the detected language (en, es, de, pt_BR).\n"
"  -h, --help        Show this help.\n"
"\n"
"Passing a .plasmoid path installs that existing package without compiling "
"the\n"
"source tree. Build dependencies are required only by actions that compile.\n"
"\n"
"Developer validation is available separately through scripts-dev/setup.sh."
msgstr ""
"Uso: scripts-user/setup.sh [opciones] [ruta/al/paquete.plasmoid]\n"
"\n"
"Compila Punchi Dock Remastered para el sistema Linux actual sin ejecutar\n"
"pruebas de desarrollo, crea un paquete .plasmoid local, lo instala y "
"gestiona\n"
"la integración con Plasma Shell.\n"
"\n"
"Si se ejecuta sin una acción principal, abre el menú interactivo de "
"configuración.\n"
"\n"
"Acciones principales (elige solo una):\n"
"  --install         Compila e instala el plasmoide localmente.\n"
"  --build-only      Compila el paquete local sin instalarlo ni reiniciar "
"Plasma.\n"
"  --package         Alias de --build-only.\n"
"  --check-deps      Verifica las dependencias de compilación para la "
"distribución actual.\n"
"  --uninstall       Desinstala el plasmoide del entorno local de Plasma.\n"
"  --restart-plasma  Reinicia Plasma Shell bajo demanda.\n"
"\n"
"Modificadores:\n"
"  -j, --jobs N      Establece el número de tareas de compilación en paralelo "
"(ej. -j 1 para modo seguro).\n"
"  --parallel N      Alias de --jobs.\n"
"  --no-restart      Omite reiniciar Plasma Shell tras instalar o "
"desinstalar.\n"
"  -y, --yes         Confirma automáticamente la solicitud de reinicio.\n"
"  --lang CÓDIGO     Invalida el idioma detectado (en, es, de, pt_BR).\n"
"  -h, --help        Muestra esta ayuda.\n"
"\n"
"Pasar una ruta a un .plasmoid instala ese paquete existente sin compilar\n"
"el árbol fuente. Las dependencias de compilación solo son requeridas por "
"acciones que compilan.\n"
"\n"
"La validación de desarrollo está disponible por separado mediante scripts-"
"dev/setup.sh."

